    E --&gt;|失败| G[评论失败详情]&#10;    H[PR 合并/关闭] --&gt; I[销毁环境]\">graph LR\n    A[PR 创建] --&gt; B[创建独立环境]\n    B --&gt; C[部署 PR 分支代码]\n    C --&gt; D[运行 E2E 测试]\n    D --&gt; E{结果}\n    E --&gt;|通过| F[标记 ✓ 可合并]\n    E --&gt;|失败| G[评论失败详情]\n    H[PR 合并/关闭] --&gt; I[销毁环境]</pre><h3 id=\"优势与实现成本\">优势与实现成本</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全隔离</td>\n<td>每个 PR 的测试不会互相影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实环境</td>\n<td>测试在类生产部署中运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无队列等待</td>\n<td>多个 PR 可同时测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可分享</td>\n<td>审查者可以直接访问 PR 环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>估算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础设施自动化</td>\n<td>Terraform/Pulumi 模板 + CI 脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动时间</td>\n<td>2-10 分钟（取决于架构复杂度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行成本</td>\n<td>按需计费，通常较低（生命周期短）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护</td>\n<td>需要自动清理和资源限额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据库管理\">数据库管理</h2><h3 id=\"e2e-测试的数据库策略\">E2E 测试的数据库策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每次运行重置</td>\n<td><code>migrate reset</code> + seed</td>\n<td>小型数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快照还原</td>\n<td>从预置快照恢复</td>\n<td>大数据量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务回滚</td>\n<td>每个测试包裹事务</td>\n<td>速度优先（仅后端集成）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命名空间隔离</td>\n<td>Schema 或 tenant 隔离</td>\n<td>并行运行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据库就绪检测\">数据库就绪检测</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function waitForDatabase(url: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const maxRetries = 30;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; maxRetries; i++) {&#10;    try {&#10;      const client = new PrismaClient({ datasources: { db: { url } } });&#10;      await client.$queryRaw`SELECT 1`;&#10;      await client.$disconnect();&#10;      return;&#10;    } catch {&#10;      await new Promise((r) =&gt; setTimeout(r, 1000));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  throw new Error(&#39;数据库未就绪&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waitForDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> maxRetries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxRetries; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrismaClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ datasources: { db: { url } } });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$queryRaw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`SELECT 1`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">$disconnect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(r, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据库未就绪'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"环境监控与告警\">环境监控与告警</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监控项</th>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>告警方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>环境启动时间</td>\n<td>&gt; 5 分钟</td>\n<td>Slack 通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘使用率</td>\n<td>&gt; 80%</td>\n<td>自动清理 + 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境残留（未销毁）</td>\n<td>&gt; 24 小时</td>\n<td>自动回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务健康检查失败</td>\n<td>连续 3 次</td>\n<td>触发重建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多 PR 共享测试环境</td>\n<td>数据冲突和状态污染</td>\n<td>短生命周期环境或命名空间隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖外部真实服务</td>\n<td>不稳定且不可控</td>\n<td>Mock 或使用沙盒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动环境搭建</td>\n<td>不可重复，有人离职即失传</td>\n<td>基础设施即代码（IaC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不检查环境就绪</td>\n<td>测试在半启动状态运行</td>\n<td>健康检查 + 重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境不清理</td>\n<td>资源泄漏和成本浪费</td>\n<td>自动 TTL + 定时清扫</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>测试环境管理的目标是消除&quot;在我机器上能跑&quot;——通过容器化统一技术栈、健康检查确认就绪、Mock 隔离外部依赖、短生命周期环境实现 PR 级隔离。环境问题占 Flaky 根因的 25%，投资于环境一致性的 ROI 通常高于修复单个 Flaky 测试。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>同章参考</strong>：<a href=\"flaky-test-management\">Flaky 测试治理</a> 中环境不稳定是 Flaky 的首要根因；<a href=\"parallel-execution\">并行执行</a> 的资源隔离需要环境管理提供基础设施保障。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试环境管理","id":"测试环境管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"环境类型与适用场景","id":"环境类型与适用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"容器化环境方案","id":"容器化环境方案"},{"level":3,"text":"Docker Compose 全栈编排","id":"docker-compose-全栈编排"},{"level":3,"text":"环境就绪检测","id":"环境就绪检测"},{"level":2,"text":"第三方服务隔离","id":"第三方服务隔离"},{"level":3,"text":"Mock 策略矩阵","id":"mock-策略矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"Playwright 网络拦截","id":"playwright-网络拦截"},{"level":3,"text":"Mock 分层原则","id":"mock-分层原则"},{"level":2,"text":"环境一致性","id":"环境一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"本地 vs CI 差异来源","id":"本地-vs-ci-差异来源"},{"level":3,"text":"消除差异的实践","id":"消除差异的实践"},{"level":2,"text":"短生命周期环境（Ephemeral Environments）","id":"短生命周期环境-ephemeral-environments"},{"level":3,"text":"优势与实现成本","id":"优势与实现成本"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库管理","id":"数据库管理"},{"level":3,"text":"E2E 测试的数据库策略","id":"e2e-测试的数据库策略"},{"level":3,"text":"数据库就绪检测","id":"数据库就绪检测"},{"level":2,"text":"环境监控与告警","id":"环境监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并行执行策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/reliability/parallel-execution"},"next":{"title":"CI 流水线集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/ci-integration/ci-pipeline-integration"}}